  "body": "## What changed\n\nRemoved the invented `-360..360` `\"travel\"` field from `arc4` in `assets/machines/tormach-770mx-microarc4.mch`.\nAdded `general.description` citing Tormach mill operator manuals (`UM10587`, `UM10864`, `UM10349`), Tormach `TD10749`, and the PathPilot Hub readings (`v2.14.4`, 770MX SIM: `G1 A370`, `G93 A400`, continuous jog to `A 1484.663`).\nKept the cumulative A-travel refusal in `assets/posts/tormach.cps` active for any machine file that states a finite travel range.\nUpdated `assets/machines/AGENTS.md`, `site/content/guide/getting-started/first-4axis-part.md`, `site/tests/test_first_4axis_part.py`, and the Tormach rotary test suites to reflect unlimited A travel on PathPilot.\nAdded the decision record in `docs/decisions/2471-microarc4-unlimited-a-travel.md`.\n\n## Cause\n\nIssue #785 set A travel to `-360..360` because `TD10749` states no stops and indexing stayed within `-180..180`.\nTormach operator manuals (`UM10587`, `UM10864`, `UM10349`, Rotational Axis) specify that PathPilot treats A as a wrapped linear axis increasing or decreasing without limit toward +/- infinity.\nLinuxCNC defaults unbounded angular limits to `-1e99..1e99`, and PathPilot Hub runs reached `A 1484.663` with no stop or alarm.\nUnder CamCraft's unstated-limit law (`assets/machines/AGENTS.md`), omitting `\"travel\"` states no travel limit (`None`), whereas `-360..360` made `assets/posts/tormach.cps` refuse legal multi-turn programs.\n\n## Tests\n\nNew pins in `crates/post/tests/tormach_rotary_travel.rs`:\n- `microarc_states_no_a_soft_limit_and_cites_sources`: asserts `a.travel == None` and source citations in `general.description`.\n- `microarc_posts_multi_turn_rotary_offset_past_four_turns`: asserts +/-1500 deg Rotary Offset streams post cleanly on the shipped machine file.\n\nNew and updated pins in `crates/app/tests/tormach_wrapped_a.rs` and `crates/app/tests/tormach_fourth_axis.rs`:\n- `shipped_microarc_posts_wrapped_a_past_four_turns`: asserts wrapped A posts cleanly through `A1500` on the shipped machine file.\n- `the_microarc_machine_states_an_a_about_x`: asserts `a.travel == None` and `rotaries[0][\"travel\"] == null`.\n- `a_count_past_the_travel_is_refused_by_name`, `positive_a_overtravel_names_the_rotary_offset_limit_and_remedy`, `negative_a_overtravel_names_the_rotary_offset_limit_and_remedy`, `rotary_offset_at_either_a_travel_boundary_still_posts`, and `an_a_past_travel_is_refused` confirm bounded machine files still refuse overtravel by name.\n\nMutation check: restoring `upstream/main`'s `assets/machines/tormach-770mx-microarc4.mch` failed `microarc_states_no_a_soft_limit_and_cites_sources`, `microarc_posts_multi_turn_rotary_offset_past_four_turns`, `shipped_microarc_posts_wrapped_a_past_four_turns`, and `the_microarc_machine_states_an_a_about_x`.\nRestoring our fix passed all of them.\n\nChecks run:\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: green, 8 steps, 0 failed.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-post -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings`: green.\n- App suites `first_4axis_part`, `fourth_axis_pose`, `index_swing`, `machine`, `machine_library`, `mcp_rotary_stack`, `rotary_subplate`, `rotary_subplate_standing`, `tormach_fourth_axis`, and `tormach_wrapped_a` passed; `microarc_test_part` failed on one pre-existing golden mismatch (`line count 3246 != 3245` on `wrap_rotary_parallel_microarc4.nc`) that also failed identically against `upstream/main`'s unmodified machine file.\n- `site/tests/test_first_4axis_part.py`: 12 passed, 1 pre-existing failure on `upstream/main` (`posting.rs` split into `posting_files.rs`, #2345); the updated machine travel assertion passed.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone. `git diff --stat upstream/main -- \"*.nc\" \"*.cl\"` is empty.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nGenerated multi-turn Rotary Offset or >1500-degree wrapped programs were not run in PathPilot Hub or on hardware.\n`zola check` and `crates/ui` suites were not run.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nPR #2346 touches `site/content/guide/getting-started/first-4axis-part.md` at a different line (intro cross-link vs machine-setup step here); whichever merges second refreshes.\nPR #2346 also appears in GitHub file queries for `tormach-770mx-microarc4.mch`, `tormach_fourth_axis.rs`, `tormach_wrapped_a.rs`, and `test_first_4axis_part.py` from inherited commits of already-merged #2342, with no diff against `upstream/main` on those files.\nLeft `site/content/guide/multi-axis/_index.md` untouched because PR #2346 edits line 33 directly.\n\nChangelog: Remove the unverified -360..360 A-travel limit from Tormach 770MX + microARC 4 so continuous multi-turn A programs post.\n\nEffort: high (no escalation)\n\nFixes #2471\n",
